{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211820","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211820","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121182001:1":{"text":"저희 왔어요! 이 재료들 좀 보세요. 꽃과 나뭇가지만 비슷하고 열매만 완전히 달라요!","source_cn":"塔琳小姐，我们回来了！请看看这些材料，相似的花和树枝，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x976A56EC9D322D2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121182002:1":{"text":"그 물건들을 제단 근처에 두고, 멀리 떨어지세요.","source_cn":"请把它们成对地安放在祭坛四周，然后远离。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B219D43E9EBE9F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121182003:2":{"text":"제가 이 재료들에 신성한 힘을 어느 정도 불어넣은 다음 악마의 주의를 끌게요. 이 기회를 통해 제단이 원래대로 돌아올 수 있도록 하겠습니다.","source_cn":"我会向这些材料注入少许神圣之力，以吸引恶魔的注意，并借...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x337715239A93F940","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121182004:1":{"text":"다들 단단히 준비하세요.","source_cn":"你们要做好准备。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56C88FA0933A279D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:塔琳":{"text":"탈렌","source":"塔琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}